{
  "abstract": "The continued-fraction minimum defining OEIS A225179 is 24 at length 150. An explicit unbordered binary word of that length has exactly 22 distinct nonempty unbordered factors, disproving the conjectured extremal interpretation. A second unbordered word has length 42 and 16 such factors. Its halves of length 21 contain 7 and 9 ones.",
